      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EAT YOUR SPINACH (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Poetic Star (23.42) in a Grade 4/5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Key chance in this line up. PYRENEES ACE (8) charged out of the boxes with a slick early split and went straight to the front, giving a huge sight but headed late when a 2.5 lengths second (23.44) over 410m at this track. Expected to feature again. LEKTRA JIMMY (1) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 1.75 lengths fourth (23.35) over 410m at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Bold showing expected. RED EYE SAMURAI (7) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
